</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“In mercy I delight, not sacrifice,”</l><l>Thou hast declared;</l><l>Thru this Thy mercy, favor in Thine eyes</l><l>We all have shared.</l><l>’Tis not of them that will nor them that run,</l><l>But of Thee showing mercy as was done.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Father, Thy mercy with Thy love and grace</l><l>Did we obtain;</l><l>And in Thy mercy, with Thee face to face,</l><l>We’ll e’er remain;</l><l>And for Thy mercy we would worship Thee</l><l>Through all our days and through eternity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
